asys (0.2.2-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.2.2 (release identity, workflow files, asys version,
    update draining, dashboard --allow-host upstream).
  * Drop the dashboard --allow-host patch (upstream).
  * Ship release.json with asys-images; one build ID for binaries and images.
  * Depend on docker-buildx (bare FROM asys-workers needs BuildKit contexts).
  * New binary package asys-flow-view (X11 viewer/editor).
  * asys-server: state under /srv/asys/host as upstream documents; the
    upgrade hook skips asys update while runs are active.

